  "solution_html": "<div class=\"float_right\">\t   <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 300\"><rect x=\"25.00\" y=\"30.00\" width=\"245.00\" height=\"245.00\" fill=\"#008000\" stroke=\"none\" /><rect x=\"25.00\" y=\"30.00\" width=\"245.00\" height=\"245.00\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff0000\" stroke-width=\"2.0\" /><rect x=\"220.00\" y=\"245.00\" width=\"50.00\" height=\"30.00\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"none\" /><rect x=\"220.00\" y=\"245.00\" width=\"50.00\" height=\"30.00\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"2.0\" /><text x=\"2.50\" y=\"152.50\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">24.5</text><text x=\"245.00\" y=\"278.75\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">5</text><text x=\"275.00\" y=\"255.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">3</text><text x=\"147.50\" y=\"10.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">24.5</text><text x=\"50.00\" y=\"225.00\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" dominant-baseline=\"hanging\">A = Lx-15</text></svg></div>\t  <div>\t  <ul class=\"wims_nopuce\">\t  <li>L'aire hors enclos est \\(A = L x - 15\\) et la longueur du grillage est \\(2 x + 2 L - 8 = 90\\) avec \\(L = 49 - x\\).</li>\t  <li>Donc \\(A = f{\\left(x \\right)} = - x^{2} + 49 x - 15\\).</li>\t  <li>Elle est maximale pour \\(x = 24.5\\) et \\(L = 24.5\\).</li>\t  </ul>\t  </div>\t",
